  "bio": "Rodrigo Assi is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in sketch and blackwork styles, based in the vibrant beach town of Balneário Camboriú, Brazil. His portfolio features exclusive designs that reflect his exceptional talent and artistic vision, earning him a reputation for excellence in the tattooing community. With a keen eye for detail and a dedication to his craft, Rodrigo creates unique, captivating pieces that are true to his signature style.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Balneário Camboriú, Santa Catarina, Brazil\n\nTatuador / Ilustrador \n.\nSKETCH/BLACKWORK\n.\n❌[Trabalhos Exclusivos]❌\n.\n📲 Agendamentos, me chame no WhatsApp!",
